# Silence the benign LD-shim probe flood.
# TARGET_LD_SHIM_LIBS (BoardConfig) makes the LOS linker inject shims into libexynoscamera.so and
# libbauthserver.so. The linker consults the shim table in EVERY process at startup and read/getattr's
# those target libs to wire the shim — so every domain (fsck, logd, apexd, ...) probes them even though
# only cameraserver / the biometric HAL actually load them. Benign; the probe failing just means the
# shim isn't wired in a process that never loads the lib anyway.
#
# The two libs are now labeled same_process_hal_file (file_contexts relabel). Real consumers keep their
# own same_process_hal_file execute/read allows; this only suppresses the non-consumer probe noise.

dontaudit domain same_process_hal_file:file { read getattr open map };
